%N A374952 Decimal expansion of 7*zeta(3)/16 + Pi^2*log(2)/8, where zeta is the Riemann zeta function.
%H A374952 Amrik Singh Nimbran and Anthony Sofo, <a href="https://doi.org/10.7153/jca-2019-15-02">New interesting Euler sums</a>, Journal of Classical Analysis, Vol. 15, No. 1 (2019), pp. 9-22. See p. 21.
%F A374952 Equals the absolute value of Integral_{x=0..Pi/2} x*log(cos x) dx.
%F A374952 Equals (Pi/2) * A173623 - A173624.
%F A374952 Sum_{k>=1} O(k)/(2*k+1)^2, where O(k) = A350669(k)/A350670(k) is the k-th odd harmonic number (or harmonic number of the second kind) (Nimbran and Sofo, 2019). - _Amiram Eldar_, Aug 28 2026
%e A374952 1.38103595311446206796832033990552137987215388392245...
